data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":85,"item_id":"rs_0093b505ebce2fc0016acaac40216487d1825c93be334af253","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering UI testing**\n\nI can add a DOM test dependency that's free, but it seems like the overhead isn't necessary right now. The current UI has been trivially verified through inspection. So, I think existing user tests should be sufficient for integration, which is useful. I should also remember to update the README to reflect these changes and make sure everything is clear and easy to understand for anyone looking at the project in the future!"}

